{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>War Untold</strong> is a WW2 inspired strategy game where you command vast armies. Deploy a wide array of ground units, including infantry, mortars, artillery, and tanks. Rain destruction from above with close air support planes and bombers, while keeping your own skies clear with fighter coverage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Command Sections and Platoons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of the battlefield, issuing orders to the infantry and armor at your disposal. Take advantage of the fog of war to launch surprise attacks, or utilize carefully fortified positions anchored by defensive terrain to bludgeon offensives. Break stalemates on the ground with aerial firepower, or employ strategic destruction to crush your opponent's economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584360/extras/gif-1.gif?t=1745692603\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Construct a Base</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every soldier on the field must be deployed from a production structure. Build barracks, armor depots, and airfields to train and reinforce your armies. Ensure a healthy economy by placing your supply hubs in areas safe from raids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584360/extras/gif-2.gif?t=1745692603\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Employ Combined Arms Warfare</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash tanks, planes and artillery barrages to shatter your opponent's resolve, followed with waves of infantry to secure territorial gains. Keep the pressure on with lightning fast raids to catch the enemy off balance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584360/extras/2025-04-14_03-31-23.gif?t=1745692603\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fight Across 30 Missions in the Campaign</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Command either the Aegis Coalition or the Titan Guard in a fully unique campaign. Tackle missions of increasing difficulty as you master the arsenals at your disposal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584360/extras/gif-8.gif?t=1745692603\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3584360?t=1745692603","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584360/b71a79e806708da1fc9bac57cf07bbabcaf1903f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745692603","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584360/e90171d78b4a753ac0700370f9e526a16f5859bd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745692603","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584360/e90171d78b4a753ac0700370f9e526a16f5859bd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745692603","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>War Untold</strong> is a WW2 inspired strategy game where you command vast armies. Deploy a wide array of ground units, including infantry, mortars, artillery, and tanks. Rain destruction from above with close air support planes and bombers, while keeping your own skies clear with fighter coverage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Command Sections and Platoons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of the battlefield, issuing orders to the infantry and armor at your disposal. Take advantage of the fog of war to launch surprise attacks, or utilize carefully fortified positions anchored by defensive terrain to bludgeon offensives. 